    "updated_at": "2019-07-18T15:08:23Z",
    "body": "My problem with this has always been that existing `<script>`s take place within the page's global scope. It's very strange to introduce something that looks so similar but behaves so drastically different. As such I've always preferred improving the story for creating workers from strings via new JS APIs, not new HTML.",
