    "body": "Yeah, to be clear, I meant assume we've solved https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/issues/49 first.  (And maybe assume that we provide some means of stuffing a URL into the response on the basis that ServiceWorkers allow origins to lie to themselves about such things, and that https://github.com/w3c/ServiceWorker/issues/1026 and the proposal at https://github.com/w3c/ServiceWorker/issues/1195#issuecomment-340781059 ties into our desire for the above fetch issue to be resolved, in which case we wouldn't have to roundtrip through a ServiceWorker.)",
